label chapter_three:
    scene bg library
    with fade

    narrator "Three weeks into the tutoring sessions."
    narrator "You've stopped calling them tutoring sessions."
    narrator "Even in your head."
    narrator "You can just call them.. Tuesday and Thursday."
    narrator "Like they just happen."

    orion "You look tired."

    mc "I'm fine."
    
    orion "That's not what I said."

    mc "I know what you said."

    narrator "He waits."
    narrator "Most people fill silence."
    narrator "He just waits."
    narrator "Like he has infinite patience for the truth to arrive."

    narrator "You hate it."
    narrator "It works every time."

    mc "I didn't sleep well."

    orion "How many hours?"

    mc "Enough."

    orion "That's not a number."

    mc "Three."

    narrator "He writes something."
    narrator "You assume it's Physics."

    orion "You've been doing that more."

    mc "Sleeping less?"

    orion "Answering questions with non-answers."

    narrator "You look at him."

    mc "I answer your Physics questions perfectly."

    orion "Yes."

    mc "Then what's the problem."

    orion "I didn't say there was a problem."

    narrator "Another silence."
    narrator "And pick up your pen."
    narrator "You put it down."

    mc "Can we just do the chapter?"

    orion "We can do whatever you want."

    jump chapter_three_notebook

label chapter_three_notebook:

    scene bg library
    with dissolve

    narrator "You're twenty minutes into Columb's Law revision."
    narrator "He's explaining the vector form."
    narrator "You're writing."
    narrator "Carefully."

    narrator "The notebook slips."
    narrator "The right side falls open."

    narrator "You grab it under a second."
    narrator "But he's already looked."

    narrator "One second."
    narrator "Maybe less."

    narrator "You close it."
    narrator "You put it face-down on the table."
    narrator "You keep writing."

    orion "What was that?"

    mc "Notes."

    orion "On the right side?"

    mc "I use both sides."

    orion "You've never written on the right side during a session before."

    narrator "You feel something cold move through you."
    narrator "The feeling of a system being observed."

    mc "I write wereever there's space."

    orion "..."

    narrator "He doesn't push."
    narrator "He goes back to the vector form."
    narrator "You go back to writing."

    narrator "But something has shifted."
    narrator "You can feel it."
    narrator "Like a charge redistribution."
    narrator "Like something that was balanced is no longer balanced."

    jump chapter_three_walk

label chapter_three_walk:

    scene bg school_corridor
    with dissolve

    narrator "You walk out together."
    narrator "This has become normal."
    narrator "You don't examine when it became normal."

    orion "Can I ask you something?"

    mc "You always ask things without asking if you can."

    orion "This one is different."

    narrator "You slow down slightly."

    mc "Go ahead."

    orion "Why do you change depending on who you're with?"

    mc "Everyone does that."

    orion "Not the way you do."

    mc "What does that mean?"

    orion "With Riya, you're softer."
    orion "With the teacher, you're precise."
    orion "With Kabir, you're more relaxed."
    orion "With me.."

    narrator "He pauses."

    orion "With me you're cautious."
    orion "Like you're deciding every word before you say it."

    narrator "You stand very still."

    mc "That's called being socially aware."

    orion "Is it?"

    orion "Or is it that you don't know which version of yourself to be around someone who notices all your versions?"

    mc "You think about me a lot."

    orion "You think about everyone a lot."
    orion "I think about you specifically."

    narrator "You don't have a response for that."
    narrator "You, who always hasve a response."
    narrator "You, who have been managing conversations since you knew the alphabet."

    narrator "Nothing."

    mc "I'll see you on Thursday."

    narrator "You walk away."

    jump chapter_three_end

